{
  "abstract": "For a continuous weakly mixing self-map of a nonempty Polish space, a comeagre set of countable sequences has every finite prefix dense under the corresponding diagonal forward orbit. A nonempty dense G-delta subset of such sequences is constructed through countable-product transitivity and a countable-basis Baire argument.",
